{"vid":"Pfg38KxMD60","source":"Pfg38KxMD60.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Want to understand native conversations"},{"t":2.1,"txt":"even if you're a beginner? Well, there"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"is an easy way to do it. A special"},{"t":5.8,"txt":"conversation breakdown tool you'll find"},{"t":7.7,"txt":"inside our system. What is it? Keep"},{"t":10.1,"txt":"watching. But first, if you don't yet"},{"t":12.3,"txt":"have access to our language learning"},{"t":13.7,"txt":"system, sign up for a free lifetime"},{"t":15.6,"txt":"account right now. Just click the link"},{"t":17.6,"txt":"in the description to [music] get your"},{"t":18.6,"txt":"free lifetime account. Your secret"},{"t":21,"txt":"weapon to understanding native"},{"t":22.9,"txt":"conversations. [music]"},{"t":24.3,"txt":"If you're like most beginners, you"},{"t":25.6,"txt":"probably struggle with listening to"},{"t":27.1,"txt":"conversations between native [music]"},{"t":28.4,"txt":"speakers. They speak faster than you're"},{"t":30.4,"txt":"used to. Their words seem to blend in"},{"t":32.6,"txt":"together and the slow pronunciation that"},{"t":34.4,"txt":"you get from most vocabulary apps simply"},{"t":36.8,"txt":"doesn't prepare you for the real [music]"},{"t":38.2,"txt":"thing. But at the same time, you'd love"},{"t":40.3,"txt":"to be able to understand them and speak"},{"t":42.2,"txt":"like them. Every learner does."},{"t":43.9,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":44,"txt":">> So what do you do? Well, most learners"},{"t":46,"txt":"just leave it as \"I'm just not good at"},{"t":47.8,"txt":"listening or speaking.\" But if you're"},{"t":49.7,"txt":"learning with our system where you learn"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"[music] from everyday conversations, you"},{"t":53,"txt":"get a special tool inside every lesson"},{"t":55.5,"txt":"called the line-by-line dialogue. You'll"},{"t":57.8,"txt":"find it inside all of our [music] audio"},{"t":59.3,"txt":"lessons and it helps you master the"},{"t":60.9,"txt":"conversations in the lessons fast, even"},{"t":63,"txt":"if you're a beginner. So, how do you"},{"t":64.7,"txt":"learn [music] with it? How to learn with"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"the line-by-line dialogue. So what the"},{"t":69.2,"txt":"line-by-line dialogue does is it breaks"},{"t":71.3,"txt":"the lesson conversation into manageable"},{"t":73.3,"txt":"chunks, one line at a time. And you'll"},{"t":75.4,"txt":"find it right below the lesson. Here's"},{"t":77.4,"txt":"what you can do. First, instead of"},{"t":79.2,"txt":"getting overwhelmed by a whole native"},{"t":81,"txt":"speed conversation, [music]"},{"t":82.4,"txt":"you can just listen to each line one at"},{"t":84.3,"txt":"a time as many times as you want. Just"},{"t":86.5,"txt":"press the play icon. You can also read"},{"t":88.8,"txt":"along as you listen [music] so that you"},{"t":90.2,"txt":"don't miss a word. And you can also"},{"t":92.2,"txt":"review the translations to understand"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"the meaning. Next, you can also practice"},{"t":96.3,"txt":"speaking by recording yourself with the"},{"t":98.1,"txt":"pronunciation practice [music] tool."},{"t":100,"txt":"Just press the microphone icon. This"},{"t":102.3,"txt":"records you saying the line and plays it"},{"t":104,"txt":"side-by-side with the native version."},{"t":106,"txt":"That way you can compare your"},{"t":107.2,"txt":"pronunciation with the native speakers"},{"t":108.7,"txt":"[music] and keep refining it. So, how"},{"t":110.9,"txt":"does all this help beginners master"},{"t":112.5,"txt":"native conversations? This is an example"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"[music] of a learning method called"},{"t":116.6,"txt":"chunking where you break something into"},{"t":118.7,"txt":"smaller chunks so you can master it"},{"t":120.5,"txt":"faster. Breaking the conversation down"},{"t":122.8,"txt":"like this helps you catch and understand"},{"t":124.9,"txt":"every [music] word, even at native"},{"t":126.3,"txt":"speed. It's much easier to handle one"},{"t":128.6,"txt":"line at a time. For best results, listen"},{"t":131.1,"txt":"to each line four or five times [music]"},{"t":133,"txt":"before moving on. Practice saying them"},{"t":135.1,"txt":"just as much, whether it's reading out"},{"t":137,"txt":"loud, shadowing the audio, or recording"},{"t":139.2,"txt":"yourself. Then, you can go back and"},{"t":141.5,"txt":"[music] listen to the whole conversation"},{"t":143,"txt":"and easily understand everything. And as"},{"t":145.6,"txt":"a bonus tip, you can use the"},{"t":147.3,"txt":"line-by-line dialogue to practice"},{"t":149.1,"txt":"writing, [music] too. Copy the lines"},{"t":151,"txt":"into a notebook to reinforce what you've"},{"t":152.8,"txt":"learned."},{"t":153.9,"txt":"So, if you want to learn the language"},{"t":155.4,"txt":"and get access to these learning tools"},{"t":157.1,"txt":"and our learning system, sign up for a"},{"t":159,"txt":"free lifetime account right now. Just"},{"t":161.2,"txt":"click the link in the description to get"},{"t":162.6,"txt":"your free lifetime account."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Want"},{"t":0.32,"w":"to"},{"t":0.36,"w":"understand"},{"t":0.92,"w":"native"},{"t":1.24,"w":"conversations"},{"t":2.12,"w":"even"},{"t":2.36,"w":"if"},{"t":2.48,"w":"you're"},{"t":2.6,"w":"a"},{"t":2.64,"w":"beginner?"},{"t":3.32,"w":"Well,"},{"t":3.56,"w":"there"},{"t":3.8,"w":"is"},{"t":3.92,"w":"an"},{"t":4.04,"w":"easy"},{"t":4.24,"w":"way"},{"t":4.4,"w":"to"},{"t":4.52,"w":"do"},{"t":4.72,"w":"it."},{"t":5.16,"w":"A"},{"t":5.24,"w":"special"},{"t":5.76,"w":"conversation"},{"t":6.44,"w":"breakdown"},{"t":6.84,"w":"tool"},{"t":7.16,"w":"you'll"},{"t":7.32,"w":"find"},{"t":7.72,"w":"inside"},{"t":8.08,"w":"our"},{"t":8.2,"w":"system."},{"t":9.04,"w":"What"},{"t":9.2,"w":"is"},{"t":9.32,"w":"it?"},{"t":9.92,"w":"Keep"},{"t":10.12,"w":"watching."},{"t":10.96,"w":"But"},{"t":11.16,"w":"first,"},{"t":11.56,"w":"if"},{"t":11.72,"w":"you"},{"t":11.84,"w":"don't"},{"t":12.12,"w":"yet"},{"t":12.28,"w":"have"},{"t":12.48,"w":"access"},{"t":12.88,"